5,0,1,talk,Minako,,"Let's begin. Since it's the first day, we have no information. I suggest we observe each other's reactions carefully.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"It's a bit frightening, isn't it? But I'm sure we can all get along and find the truth together.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,Agreed. Logic is our best tool here. I'll be watching for any inconsistencies in how people speak.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A delightful challenge. I shall endeavor to maintain a rational perspective, though I suspect some of us are hiding secrets.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm excited! Let's just be honest with each other, okay? I'll do my best to help the village!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minako,,"Honesty is key, Kenji, but remember that some roles require deception. We must be cautious.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"You're so right, Minako. We must be kind, but we must also be vigilant.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,Does anyone have a strategy they'd like to propose for the first few rounds?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,Perhaps we should look for those who are overly eager to deflect suspicion or those who are too quiet.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'm not being too eager, am I? I just want us to win!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minako,,"Not necessarily, Kenji. Your energy is normal for you.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shizue,,He's a dear boy. I think we should just listen to everyone for now.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,I agree with Shizue. Let's gather more data before we make any accusations.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,A prudent approach. I shall spend my time analyzing the flow of this conversation.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"Thanks, everyone! I'll keep listening too.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
