31,1,1,talk,Minako,,"We have no deaths yet, as expected. Does anyone have any insights or suspicions?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Shizue,,Everything seems so peaceful. I hope we don't have to hurt anyone.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"The peace is an illusion. One of us is a werewolf. Benjamin, you've been very quiet.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Quiet? I was merely reflecting. However, I have a very strong feeling about one of our companions.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Who is it, Benjamin? Tell us!","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Minako,,"Be careful, Benjamin. If you are the Seer, revealing your target too early might make you a target.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Oh dear, is there already tension? Please, let's stay calm.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Minako is right. But if Benjamin has a lead, it could save us a lot of time.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"I appreciate the concern, Minako. But the truth is often the most efficient path. Shizue, you seem far too innocent.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Kenji,,Shizue? No way! She's the kindest person here!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Minako,,"Kenji, don't let emotions cloud your judgment. Benjamin is usually very logical.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I assure you, I only wish for everyone's safety. I'm just a simple old woman.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"That's exactly what a werewolf would say to evoke sympathy. Benjamin, are you claiming to be the Seer?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed I am. And my divination last night confirmed that Shizue is the werewolf.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I can't believe it! Are you sure, Benjamin?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Minako,,"If Benjamin is the Seer, the choice is clear. I trust his rationality over Shizue's kindness.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I am so sad that you would believe this. I truly am human.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,The evidence provided by a Seer is the only concrete fact we can have. I'll vote with Benjamin.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a regrettable necessity, but the logic is sound.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I... I guess I have to trust the Seer. I'm sorry, Shizue!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
